# id_map.json / event_id_map.<venue>.json are deliberately NOT ignored -- they
# are the Bookeo<->SCS correlation tables and the fast-path idempotency cache
# (rebuildable from SCS via `push_events.py rebuild <venue> ...`). One file per
# venue: event_id_map.burleson.json, event_id_map.hurst.json, ...
# They hold opaque IDs + status + timestamps only, no names/emails/phones.
.id_map_*.tmp
__pycache__/
*.pyc
